OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and bright start to
OL,6,FWednesday, but soon becoming rather
OL,7,Fwarm. Cloud will steadily increase
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, although
OL,9,Fremaining dry. Winds starting light
OL,10,Fbut becoming breezy into the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWednesday night is expected
OL,13,Fto be cloudy and breezy, with most
OL,14,Fareas remaining rather mild. Dry
OL,15,Fconditions are likely to persist
OL,16,Facross the region throughout the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
