OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloudy and rather warm for
OL,6,Fmuch of Thursday, with most areas
OL,7,Fstaying dry throughout the day. A band
OL,8,Fof rain then moves across the region
OL,9,Fovernight. Breezy until later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCooler
OL,12,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,13,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,14,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,15,Fspreading inland. Winds mostly light,
OL,16,Fbut breezy at times near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
